{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["According to all that I show you — all the forms of the vessels and of the structures the Holy One, blessed be He, showed Moshe in actuality, as we find in Ezekiel regarding the second temple, which He showed him in Babylonia in divine visions, וגם בדיבור הראה לו ופירש לו as is written; and thus it proves right before us: ככל אשר אתה מראה בהר — if it were by speech alone it would say אשר אתה מראה; why was it necessary to say בהר?"], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The phrase וגם בדיבור הראה לו ופירש לו appears to be a partial quotation of Ezekiel 43:11; left in Hebrew as his supporting citation."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:00.072402256Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}